# Line endings
# This repo's .js source uses CRLF by established convention (see git history:
# "style: format code with Prettier, restore CRLF line endings"). This file
# makes that explicit and enforced by git itself, instead of relying on each
# editor/tool to agree on its own. See notes/issues/ for the incident this
# was added to prevent.
*.js text eol=crlf

# Everything else stays LF (the git/tooling default) unless stated otherwise.
*.md text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf

# Binary assets — never text-normalize these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.wav binary
